{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And they journeyed from Rithmah.</b> This is what is said in the perasha of Shelach: 'turn tomorrow and journey for yourselves into the wilderness'; and this is what is said in the perasha of Devarim: 'we turned and journeyed into the wilderness by the way of the Sea of Reeds.' From there onward they circled Mount Seir through all the places written here, until 'and they encamped in the wilderness of Zin' — that is Kadesh — as is said in the perasha of Chukkat: 'the children of Israel came, the whole congregation, into the wilderness of Zin,' etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:36.598521436Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}